{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259720/extras/86766628678c55ea53f499deb5a756cc.avif?t=1759136888\" width=890 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Mercenaries</strong>. Your mission is to hunt down the most <strong>Powerful Creatures</strong>. Each of them has <strong>Unique Abilities</strong>, some of which can completely turn the <strong>Gameplay</strong> upside down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can <strong>interact with the Arena</strong>, <strong>possess Players</strong>, <strong>freeze Mouse Sensitivity</strong>, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259720/extras/cb119fde77634d3ec6abef42d02d713d.avif?t=1759136888\" width=890 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit your Allies</strong>, <strong>Heal your Enemies</strong>! <strong>Steal Treasures</strong> from other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is built around a <strong>Cooperative Experience</strong>. You can mess with your teammates in all sorts of ways or stick together as a <strong>United Team</strong> to overcome challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 main classes in the game \u2013 <strong>Attacker</strong>, <strong>Defender</strong>, <strong>Healer</strong>, and <strong>Strategist</strong>. Deal <strong>Massive Damage</strong>, <strong>Remove Negative Effects</strong>, or use your abilities to <strong>Reposition Players in Battle</strong>. The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember \u2013 <strong>Mistakes are Inevitable</strong>. Because...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259720/extras/1da3988ea1abcd47882d3e5ea160b323.avif?t=1759136888\" width=890 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time per Turn is Limited</strong>! <strong>VERY LIMITED</strong>! And in that time, you must <strong>Discuss Strategy</strong> with everyone and make a <strong>Brilliant Move</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But most likely\u2026 someone will <strong>Knock the Boss</strong> into the poor <strong>Healer</strong>. Which will cause the <strong>Attacker to Miss</strong>. The <strong>Healer</strong> will try to save the team, but then gets <strong>Teleported Away by the Strategist</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do <strong>NOT see</strong> what your teammates are planning to do. That\u2019s why it\u2019s so important to <strong>Talk it Over</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Otherwise, someone may <strong>Die</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259720/extras/7910dd6ec3110c6fa7a6b3df87867cc6.avif?t=1759136888\" width=890 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Events</strong>, <strong>Mysterious Artifacts</strong>, and numerous <strong>Bosses with Different Modifiers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you and your friends overcome all challenges and become <strong>Legendary Mercenaries</strong>?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3259720?t=1759136888","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3259720?t=1759136888","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259720/beb675855dddf4e8cde3b6a1a0c2564ae3f6da5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759136888","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259720/beb675855dddf4e8cde3b6a1a0c2564ae3f6da5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759136888","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259720/extras/86766628678c55ea53f499deb5a756cc.avif?t=1759136888\" width=890 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Mercenaries</strong>. Your mission is to hunt down the most <strong>Powerful Creatures</strong>. Each of them has <strong>Unique Abilities</strong>, some of which can completely turn the <strong>Gameplay</strong> upside down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can <strong>interact with the Arena</strong>, <strong>possess Players</strong>, <strong>freeze Mouse Sensitivity</strong>, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259720/extras/cb119fde77634d3ec6abef42d02d713d.avif?t=1759136888\" width=890 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit your Allies</strong>, <strong>Heal your Enemies</strong>! <strong>Steal Treasures</strong> from other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is built around a <strong>Cooperative Experience</strong>. You can mess with your teammates in all sorts of ways or stick together as a <strong>United Team</strong> to overcome challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 main classes in the game \u2013 <strong>Attacker</strong>, <strong>Defender</strong>, <strong>Healer</strong>, and <strong>Strategist</strong>. Deal <strong>Massive Damage</strong>, <strong>Remove Negative Effects</strong>, or use your abilities to <strong>Reposition Players in Battle</strong>. The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember \u2013 <strong>Mistakes are Inevitable</strong>. Because...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259720/extras/1da3988ea1abcd47882d3e5ea160b323.avif?t=1759136888\" width=890 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time per Turn is Limited</strong>! <strong>VERY LIMITED</strong>! And in that time, you must <strong>Discuss Strategy</strong> with everyone and make a <strong>Brilliant Move</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But most likely\u2026 someone will <strong>Knock the Boss</strong> into the poor <strong>Healer</strong>. Which will cause the <strong>Attacker to Miss</strong>. The <strong>Healer</strong> will try to save the team, but then gets <strong>Teleported Away by the Strategist</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do <strong>NOT see</strong> what your teammates are planning to do. That\u2019s why it\u2019s so important to <strong>Talk it Over</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Otherwise, someone may <strong>Die</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259720/extras/7910dd6ec3110c6fa7a6b3df87867cc6.avif?t=1759136888\" width=890 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Events</strong>, <strong>Mysterious Artifacts</strong>, and numerous <strong>Bosses with Different Modifiers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you and your friends overcome all challenges and become <strong>Legendary Mercenaries</strong>?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Alebardium"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259720/header.jpg?t=1759136888","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3259720/775273/79d54cb6636de2eab74ce80d33c0099e5fc2326c/1750885406/dash_av1.mpd?t=1730405387","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3259720/775273/79d54cb6636de2eab74ce80d33c0099e5fc2326c/1750885406/dash_h264.mpd?t=1730405387","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3259720/775273/79d54cb6636de2eab74ce80d33c0099e5fc2326c/1750885406/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1730405387","id":257067273,"name":"Trailer (for the contest RSV 2024)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257067273/a76bc694312cdef63f421aaedef8625b95c5dc35/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1730405387"}],"name":"Few Seconds - Many Deaths!","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i3-13100T<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 460<br></li><li><stro